{"language_code":"spa","language_probability":1.0,"text":"Lucía y Marcos cobran lo mismo y ahorran lo mismo: doscientos euros al mes, pero uno se jubila con siete veces más dinero. Lucía lo guarda en el banco. Marcos lo mete en un fondo indexado. A los treinta y cinco, la diferencia es pequeña. A los cuarenta y cinco, Marcos ya tiene más del doble. Y a los sesenta y cinco, noventa y seis mil euros contra casi setecientos mil. Y con la inflación, los noventa y seis mil de Lucía valdrán como cuarenta y tres mil de hoy. Los dos pusieron lo mismo, solo cambió dónde. Tú eres Lucía o Marcos. Guárdalo y sígueme para ser Marcos.","words":[{"text":"Lucía","start":0.14,"end":0.44,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0021818898458150215},{"text":" ","start":0.44,"end":0.46,"type":"spacing","logprob":-3.099436753473128e-6},{"text":"y","start":0.46,"end":0.48,"type":"word","logprob":-3.099436753473128e-6},{"text":" ","start":0.48,"end":0.56,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.000013947389561508317},{"text":"Marcos","start":0.56,"end":0.84,"type":"word","logprob":-0.000013947389561508317},{"text":" ","start":0.84,"end":0.9,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.003717537270858884},{"text":"cobran","start":0.9,"end":1.14,"type":"word","logprob":-0.003717537270858884},{"text":" ","start":1.14,"end":1.16,"type":"spacing","logprob":-1.1920922133867862e-6},{"text":"lo","start":1.16,"end":1.22,"type":"word","logprob":-1.1920922133867862e-6},{"text":" ","start":1.22,"end":1.26,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.00006151010165922344},{"text":"mismo","start":1.26,"end":1.52,"type":"word","logprob":-0.00006151010165922344},{"text":" ","start":1.52,"end":1.78,"type":"spacing","logprob":0.0},{"text":"y","start":1.78,"end":1.84,"type":"word","logprob":0.0},{"text":" ","start":1.84,"end":1.9,"type":"spacing","logprob":-0.0005072260973975062},{"text":"ahorran","start":1.9,"end":2.24,"type":"word","logprob":-0.0002935219267133756},{"text":" ","start":2.24,"end":2.28,"type":"spacing","logprob":-5.960462772236497e-7},{"text":"